# {{NAME}} ({{SYMBOL}}) — Devnet Faucet Token

A faucet token for testing. Anyone can claim tokens every `{{COOLDOWN_BLOCKS}}` blocks.

> ⚠️ Intended for devnet/testing only.

## Parameters

| Parameter | Description |
|---|---|
| `NAME` | Token name |
| `SYMBOL` | Token symbol |
| `TOTAL_SUPPLY` | Faucet reserve supply |
| `DRIP_AMOUNT` | Tokens per claim |
| `COOLDOWN_BLOCKS` | Blocks to wait between claims |

## Usage

1. Deploy the contract
2. Call `claim()` to receive tokens
3. Call `balance(your_address)` to check your balance
4. Call `next_claim_block(your_address)` to see when you can claim again
